  "details": "Hey there. I know that you all have heard plenty about people’s thoughts on the recent update, so I won’t go on with that. However, I have had a suggestion I think would be fun and interesting.\nSomeone like myself who does impressions likes to change their username from time to time. My idea is: Keep the 90 day cooldown, However: maybe add an ability to purchase a name change for $5, in order to override the wait. That way you could make some side money and people could change their name if they so please. Just a neat suggestion.",
